        <ids:property instructions="GroundFaultFunction || from IFC documentation: Applying ground fault function. A flag indicating that the ground fault function of the device is used. The value should be set to FALSE for devices not having a ground fault function, or if the ground fault function is not selected to be used." dataType="IFCBOOLEAN">
